#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:64
#, kde-format
msgid "Welcome to Wyrm"
msgstr "Vitaj vo Wyrm"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:69
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This wizard will help you set up Wyrm on your headset and connect it to your "
"computer."
msgstr ""
"Tento sprievodca vám pomôže nastaviť Wyrm na vašom headsete a pripojiť ho k "
"počítaču."

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:83 dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:249
#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:409 dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:446
#, kde-format
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Ďalej"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:112
#, kde-format
msgid "How to enable developer mode"
msgstr "Ako zapnúť režim pre vývojárov"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:119
#, kde-format
msgid "Follow the manufacturer's instructions below:"
msgstr "Postupujte podľa inštrukcií od výrobcu:"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:142
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"In order to use Wyrm, you will have to install the client app on your "
"headset.\n"
"Install the matching Wyrm client directly over USB."
msgstr ""

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:155
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A newer release is available: %1 → %2. Use a client that matches your server "
"version."
msgstr ""

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:162
#, kde-format
msgid "This is a development build. Use a client built from the same revision."
msgstr ""

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:172
#, kde-format
msgctxt "displayed between 'meta store' and 'install over USB' in the wizard"
msgid "Or"
msgstr "Alebo"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:178
#, kde-format
msgid "Install over USB"
msgstr "Nainštalovať cez USB"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:210
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>No headset detected. Make sure that:\n"
"<ul><li>The ADB udev rules are installed</li><li>The headset is in <a "
"href=\"#\">developer mode</a></li></ul></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Headset nebol rozpoznaný. Uistite sa, že:\n"
"<ul><li>Máte nainštalované udev pravidlá pre ADB</li><li>headset je vo  <a "
"href=\"#\">režim pre vývojárov</a></li></ul></p>"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:286
#, kde-format
msgid "Important information"
msgstr "Dôležité informácie"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:292
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Wyrm entirely replaces SteamVR, you should not start SteamVR while Wyrm is "
"running."
msgstr ""
"Wyrm úplne nahrádza SteamVR, preto by ste SteamVR nemali spúšťať, ak je Wyrm "
"spustený."

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:304
#, kde-format
msgid "Start the Wyrm app on your headset"
msgstr "Spustite aplikáciu Wyrm v headsete"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:310
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To connect over WiFi, start the Wyrm app on your headset, connect to \"%1\" "
"and enter PIN \"%2\"."
msgstr ""
"Na pripojenie cez Wi-Fi spustite aplikáciu Wyrm v headsete, pripojte sa k "
"\"%1“ a zadajte PIN \"%2“."

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:317
#, kde-format
msgid "To connect over USB, click on \"Connect by USB\"."
msgstr "Pre pripojenie cez USB kliknite na \"Pripojiť cez USB“."

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:320
#, kde-format
msgid "Connect by USB"
msgstr "Pripojiť cez USB"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:340
#, kde-format
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Riešenie problémov"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:349
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If the server is not visible or the connection fails, check that ports 5353 "
"(UDP) and 9757 (TCP and UDP) are open in your firewall."
msgstr ""
"Ak server nie je viditeľný alebo pripojenie zlyhá, skontrolujte, či máte vo "
"firewalle otvorené porty 5353 (UDP) a 9757 (TCP aj UDP)."

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:362
#, kde-format
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Preskočiť"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:382
#, kde-format
msgid "Connection established"
msgstr "Pripojenie nadviazané"

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:387
#, kde-format
msgid "Your headset is now connected."
msgstr "Headset je teraz pripojený."

#: dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:392 dashboard/qml/WizardPage.qml:434
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"To connect another headset, make sure pairing is enabled in the dashboard "
"before connecting."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete pripojiť ďalší headset, uistite sa, že je v ovládacom paneli "
"zapnuté párovanie."

